00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.960
and only size the position

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:07.520
if the beat coincides with at least 150% of average turnover.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:13.160
This approach worked best during the 2023 to 2025 AI expansion

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.020
when volume spikes reliably proceeded multi-week runs.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.360
It fails when volume is light

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.800
because the move is driven by short covering

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.980
